{"id":"3d83d56c75f26def","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-boolean-existence.md","title":"Boolean Algebra Existence","display":"thm-boolean-existence — Boolean Algebra Existence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-boolean-existence","aliases":["58-thm-boolean-existence"],"display":"thm-boolean-existence — Boolean Algebra Existence","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-complete-boolean.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-boolean-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-boolean-existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-boolean-existence — Boolean Algebra Existence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6995d561bb55c2ab\" href=\"?note=6995d561bb55c2ab\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e28385785e6b2872\" href=\"?note=e28385785e6b2872\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md\">../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"258c3795028ee0ac\" href=\"?note=258c3795028ee0ac\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-complete-boolean.md\">../batch09/58-df-complete-boolean.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},i,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb B,\\leq_{\\mathbb B},i,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6995d561bb55c2ab\" href=\"?note=6995d561bb55c2ab\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseEmb}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseEmb}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e28385785e6b2872\" href=\"?note=e28385785e6b2872\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md\">../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"258c3795028ee0ac\" href=\"?note=258c3795028ee0ac\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-complete-boolean.md\">../batch09/58-df-complete-boolean.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}existence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\n\\exists\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,i,\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\n\\leq_{\\mathbb B}=\\{\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\mathbb B^2:b\\wedge c=b\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{DenseEmb}_S(i,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0\\},\n\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\cap((\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0\\})^2))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}existence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\n\\exists\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,i,\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\n\\leq_{\\mathbb B}=\\{\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\mathbb B^2:b\\wedge c=b\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{DenseEmb}_S(i,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0\\},\n\\leq_{\\mathbb B}\\cap((\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0\\})^2))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every separative forcing notion densely embeds into the nonzero part of its complete Boolean completion; arbitrary forcing notions first pass to the separative quotient.</li>\n<li>This is the basis for Boolean-valued forcing.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"6995d561bb55c2ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"e28385785e6b2872","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-complete-boolean.md","status":"resolved","id":"258c3795028ee0ac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-complete-boolean.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"6995d561bb55c2ab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSeparativePoset}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing-separative-poset.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-dense-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"e28385785e6b2872","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]"